WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:07.278
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Online Class!

2
00:00:07.328 --> 00:00:10.128
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:10.178 --> 00:00:11.856
Unit nine. Sounds

4
00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:17.307
Let's learn eight new words. Listen, then it's your turn to say it!

5
00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.096
Loud!

6
00:00:20.146 --> 00:00:25.279
Loud. Your turn!

7
00:00:25.329 --> 00:00:26.821
Loud!

8
00:00:26.871 --> 00:00:28.039
Great!

9
00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.599
Quiet!

10
00:00:30.649 --> 00:00:35.643
Quiet. Your turn!

11
00:00:35.693 --> 00:00:36.801
Quiet!

12
00:00:36.851 --> 00:00:38.001
Super!

13
00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:40.593
Ring!

14
00:00:40.643 --> 00:00:45.730
Ring. Your turn!

15
00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:46.865
Ring!

16
00:00:46.915 --> 00:00:48.336
Well done!

17
00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:50.558
Beep!

18
00:00:50.608 --> 00:00:55.288
Beep. Your turn!

19
00:00:55.338 --> 00:00:56.400
Beep!

20
00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:57.600
Yes!

21
00:00:58.628 --> 00:01:00.255
Knock!

22
00:01:00.305 --> 00:01:05.311
Knock. Your turn!

23
00:01:05.361 --> 00:01:06.434
Knock!

24
00:01:06.484 --> 00:01:07.711
Good job!

25
00:01:08.592 --> 00:01:10.381
Whisper!

26
00:01:10.431 --> 00:01:15.634
Whisper. Your turn!

27
00:01:15.684 --> 00:01:16.932
Whisper!

28
00:01:16.982 --> 00:01:18.297
Wonderful!

29
00:01:19.159 --> 00:01:20.495
Shout!

30
00:01:20.545 --> 00:01:25.737
Shout. Your turn!

31
00:01:25.787 --> 00:01:27.150
Shout!

32
00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.350
Nice!

33
00:01:29.518 --> 00:01:31.086
Buzz!

34
00:01:31.136 --> 00:01:36.096
Buzz. Your turn!

35
00:01:36.146 --> 00:01:37.428
Buzz!

36
00:01:37.478 --> 00:01:38.865
Excellent!

37
00:01:39.644 --> 00:01:48.534
Loud, Loud, Loud! Quiet, Quiet, Quiet! Ring, Ring, Ring! Beep, Beep, Beep!

38
00:01:48.584 --> 00:01:58.286
Knock, Knock, Knock! Whisper, Whisper, Whisper! Shout, Shout, Shout! Buzz, Buzz, Buzz!

39
00:01:58.336 --> 00:02:01.772
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:02:02.532 --> 00:02:11.686
Knock, knock! Who is at the door? The bell can ring and the car can beep. Shh, please whisper. The baby is sleeping.

41
00:02:11.736 --> 00:02:14.232
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

42
00:02:15.232 --> 00:02:21.085
What is it? Can you say it?

43
00:02:21.135 --> 00:02:23.640
Buzz! Well done!

44
00:02:24.854 --> 00:02:30.130
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:32.311
Knock! Well done!

46
00:02:33.487 --> 00:02:39.061
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:39.111 --> 00:02:41.425
Ring! Well done!

48
00:02:42.654 --> 00:02:44.516
Let's say it together!

49
00:02:44.566 --> 00:02:48.436
The drum is loud. A whisper is quiet.

50
00:02:48.486 --> 00:02:53.154
Your turn!

51
00:02:53.204 --> 00:02:56.883
The drum is loud. A whisper is quiet.

52
00:02:58.119 --> 00:03:04.976
What sound is loud? What sound is quiet?

53
00:03:05.026 --> 00:03:06.784
The drum is loud.

54
00:03:06.834 --> 00:03:08.224
Great answer!

55
00:03:09.152 --> 00:03:14.924
Today's value is consideration. Use a quiet voice when someone is sleeping.

56
00:03:14.974 --> 00:03:17.135
I will try, Ms. Lily!

57
00:03:18.011 --> 00:03:24.257
Great job today, everyone! See you in Unit ten. Bye-bye!

58
00:03:24.307 --> 00:03:25.517
Bye-bye!

